    {
      "id": "r20261026-a01",
      "title": "The Old Bicycle",
      "level": "Dasar",
      "min": 2,
      "body": [
        "Rafi found an old bicycle in his grandfather's garage. It was dirty and the tires were flat, but Rafi loved its bright blue color.",
        "Grandfather smiled and said, \"That was my bicycle when I was your age. Let's fix it together.\" They cleaned it, changed the tires, and painted the rusty parts.",
        "Now Rafi rides the blue bicycle to school every day. His friends think it is cool because it looks classic. For Rafi, it is special because he fixed it with his grandfather."
      ],
      "gloss": {
        "found": "menemukan",
        "garage": "garasi",
